SUMMARY:Compute! Paris 2026
DESCRIPTION:Compute! Paris\nJoin us at the first edition of **Compute! Par
 is**.\n\n**Please follow this [link](https://compute.events/paris2026/tick
 ets) for registration.**\nCompute! is a new conference series dedicated to
  **open-source data science\, AI/ML\, and scientific computing**. The even
 t will take place on **November 25–26\, 2026**\, at the **Hotel du Port*
 * in **Nogent-sur-Marne**.\n\nWe’re excited to present an outstanding li
 neup of keynote speakers:\n\n* **Fernando Pérez**\, founder of **Project 
 Jupyter** and a leading voice in open-source scientific computing.\n* **Ma
 ckenzie Mathis**\, a pioneer in **neuroscience and AI**\, advancing resear
 ch at the intersection of data and biology.\n* **Inès Montani**\, co-foun
 der of explosion.ai and creator of **spaCy**\, a leading NLP library.\n* *
 *Wolf Vollprecht**\, creator of **Pixi** and CEO of Prefix.dev \, revoluti
 onizing package management for scientific computing.\n\n**Please follow th
 is [link](https://compute.events/paris2026/tickets) for registration.**
